% NY N360338 (April 2026): a women's upper body garment.
scenario ny_n360338 is, as stated in ruling NY N360338:
    style A2726-4 is an upper body garment,
        confer "Bomber Jacket – Valley of the Fleurs” is a women’s upper body garment constructed from knit fabric".
    style A2726-4 is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the fabric construction of style A2726-4 is knitted,
        confer "upper body garment constructed from knit fabric".
    the cut of style A2726-4 indicates women,
        confer "Bomber Jacket – Valley of the Fleurs” is a women’s upper body garment constructed from knit fabric".
    style A2726-4 has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "Style A2726-4 features a full-front opening with a zippered closure".
    style A2726-4 has a collar,
        confer "a rib knit band collar".
    style A2726-4 has pockets below the waist,
        confer "vertical pockets with zippered closures on the front panels below the waist".
    style A2726-4 contains 96 percent of cotton,
        according to the importer, confer "will have a fiber content of 96 percent cotton and 4 percent spandex",
        because "the fibre content of the garment as imported, not of the sample".
    style A2726-4 contains 4 percent of spandex,
        according to the importer, confer "will have a fiber content of 96 percent cotton and 4 percent spandex",
        because "the fibre content of the garment as imported, not of the sample".
    style A2726-4 is claimed to belong to outerwear,
