    the claim that style A2726-4 belongs to outerwear is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "the sample garment lacks the character of an outerwear jacket",
        because "the sample lacks the character of an outerwear jacket designed for wear over all other clothing for protection against the weather".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style A2726-4 is 6110.20"].

